[Full referee report](analytic_referee_report.txt) — 4,170 words, with verdicts, locations, derivations, and primary-source checks.

The analytic chain closes, including \(V^4/Y^2\asymp S^4\). Theorem R is unnecessary, and the independent parameter calculation confirms \(k=13\) is minimal at \(d=9\), with runtime-constant infimum \(0.9192388155\ldots\).

The main correction: U4’s inverse-polylogarithmic bound for \(\gamma\) fails for the explicit choice of \(S\). The sufficient bound \(\gamma\ge L^{-o(1)}\) survives. Other fixes concern Tenenbaum’s quoted hypothesis, averaging over \(\ell\), and the formal scope of LD*. This recommendation covers the analytic half; LV6’s algebraic machinery remains an input.

WHOLE-THEOREM VERDICT: ACCEPT WITH FIXES  
